@startuml booking-sequence
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
title Здоровье+ — успешная SAGA консультации, оплаты и лабораторного резерва
autonumber
actor Пациент as Patient
participant "Мобильное\nприложение" as App
participant "API Gateway\nи patient API" as API
participant "SAGA worker\n+ durable state/outbox" as Saga
participant Расписание as Schedule
participant "Шлюз ДМС\n→ 1С" as Policy
participant "Платёжный модуль\n+ ledger/inbox" as Pay
participant PSP
participant "LIS booking\nadapter" as Lab
participant Уведомления as Notify

Patient -> App: Выбрать приём и анализы
App -> API: POST booking-operations\nBearer + Idempotency-Key
API -> Saga: Транзакция: operation + dedup + outbox
Saga --> API: operationId, durable accepted
API --> App: 202 + Location операции
Saga -> Schedule: hold(slot, operation step key)
Schedule --> Saga: reservationId + version + expiry
Saga -> Policy: Покрытие patient/service/clinic/date
Policy --> Saga: Подтверждённое решение + reference
note over Saga, Policy: Ветка с ДМС. Unknown не valid; без ДМС шаг не нужен.
Saga -> Pay: createPayment(operationId, server quote)
Pay -> PSP: Create session с устойчивым ключом
PSP --> Pay: paymentId, actionUrl
Pay --> Saga: PAYMENT_PENDING + actionUrl
App -> API: GET operation
API --> App: PAYMENT_PENDING, actionUrl
App -> PSP: Открыть hosted payment flow
Patient -> PSP: Подтвердить оплату
PSP -> Pay: Подписанный callback: captured
Pay -> Pay: Проверить подпись, сумму, reference\nInbox + paid + outbox
Pay --> Saga: Подтверждённый PAID (durable event)
note over Pay, PSP: Redirect не доказывает оплату. Потеря callback закрывается status query.
Saga -> Lab: reserveCollectionSlot(step key)
Lab --> Saga: labReservationId + expiry
note over Saga, Lab: Capability reserve/confirm/release требуется подтвердить до запуска.
Saga -> Lab: confirm(labReservationId, version)
Lab --> Saga: Confirmed
Saga -> Schedule: confirm(reservationId, version)
Schedule --> Saga: appointmentId, confirmed
Saga -> Saga: Транзакция: CONFIRMED + notification outbox
Saga ->> Notify: BookingConfirmed через RabbitMQ
App -> API: GET operation / appointments
API --> App: CONFIRMED и собственная запись
Notify ->> Patient: Нейтральное подтверждение (async)
note over Saga, Notify: Сбой push не откатывает запись. Compensations и unknown-outcome ветки — в booking-saga.md.
@enduml
